  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ust-Kamenogorsk Environmental Remediation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has two development objectives: (i) Prevent the groundwater contamination plume&apos;s further migration towards the residential areascomma the city&apos;s sources of drinking water supply and eventually into the Irtysh River; and (ii) Strengthen institutional mechanisms for groundwater quality monitoring to enable control of ongoing groundwater pollution from local municipal and industrial sources.</narrative>
  </description>
